  "releaseNotes": "0.9.0 adds a contained zipfile subset with CRC-validated STORED/DEFLATED reads and staged archives; hardens difflib matching, OpenPyXL loading and gzip finalization; makes csv.reader/DictReader single-pass iterators with governed field ownership and reclamation; streams open() reads through ranged host I/O with async CSV iteration; and extends memory-governor containment to writers, literals and conversions.",
